    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24384" root="صغر" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَغِيرَةٌ</span></b> , [a subst. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَغِيرٌ</span>, made such by the
affix <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>,] applied to a sin, [signifying <i>A small</i> or
<i>little, sin,</i>] has for its pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَغِيرَاتٌ</span> and [more commonly] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَغَائِرُ</span>; being, when thus applied, a subst.
(Msb.) [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحَقَّرَاتٌ</span>.]

